  "notes": "Smoke-only manual power-off ordering correction. The existing one-second hold now starts the 750 ms shutdown animation while Wake is still held; releasing Wake is the separate final gate that powers down PERIPHERY and enters deep sleep. BLE shutdown, persistence and wake-source setup still finish before the animation, so no variable-latency work remains after release and the previous hidden unresponsive interval does not return. A regression policy test enforces animation before release waiting. Startup timing, battery indication, BLE protocol and Twin Button firmware content are unchanged from 2.3.121.",
